{"seq":1,"slug":"csp","title":"内容安全策略 CSP","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/defense-strategies/csp","wordCount":546,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"内容安全策略-csp\">内容安全策略 CSP</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>内容安全策略（Content Security Policy, CSP）是一种浏览器安全机制，通过 HTTP 响应头或 <code>&lt;meta&gt;</code> 标签声明页面允许加载和执行的资源来源。CSP 的核心设计思想是&quot;白名单机制&quot;——默认禁止所有不在白名单中的资源，从根本上减少 XSS 和数据注入攻击的攻击面。</p>\n<p>CSP 不是替代输入验证和输出转义的银弹，而是纵深防御体系的最后一道防线。即使攻击者成功注入了恶意脚本，CSP 也能阻止其加载外部资源或执行内联代码。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;CSP 策略&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;default-src&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;script-src&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;style-src&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;img-src&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; F[&quot;connect-src&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; G[&quot;frame-ancestors&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;所有资源的默认策略&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;&#39;self&#39;&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;&#39;nonce-xxx&#39;&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[&quot;&#39;strict-dynamic&#39;&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[&quot;API/WebSocket 来源&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"CSP 策略\"] --&gt; B[\"default-src\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"script-src\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"style-src\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"img-src\"]\n    A --&gt; F[\"connect-src\"]\n    A --&gt; G[\"frame-ancestors\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"所有资源的默认策略\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"'self'\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"'nonce-xxx'\"]\n    C --&gt; C3[\"'strict-dynamic'\"]\n    F --&gt; F1[\"API/WebSocket 来源\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指令</th>\n<th>控制资源</th>\n<th>常用值</th>\n<th>安全级别</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>default-src</td>\n<td>所有资源默认</td>\n<td>&#39;self&#39;</td>\n<td>基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>script-src</td>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td>&#39;self&#39; &#39;nonce-xxx&#39;</td>\n<td>关键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>style-src</td>\n<td>CSS</td>\n<td>&#39;self&#39; &#39;unsafe-inline&#39;</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>img-src</td>\n<td>图片</td>\n<td>&#39;self&#39; data: https:</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>connect-src</td>\n<td>AJAX/WebSocket</td>\n<td>&#39;self&#39; <a href=\"https://api.x.com\">https://api.x.com</a></td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>font-src</td>\n<td>字体</td>\n<td>&#39;self&#39; <a href=\"https://fonts.x.com\">https://fonts.x.com</a></td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>frame-src</td>\n<td>iframe</td>\n<td>&#39;none&#39;</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>frame-ancestors</td>\n<td>谁可以嵌入本页</td>\n<td>&#39;none&#39;</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>base-uri</td>\n<td>&lt;base&gt; 标签</td>\n<td>&#39;self&#39;</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>form-action</td>\n<td>表单提交目标</td>\n<td>&#39;self&#39;</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"策略配置实践\">策略配置实践</h2><p>从宽松到严格的渐进式 CSP 配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const strictCsp = (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) =&gt; {&#10;  const nonce = crypto.randomBytes(16).toString(&#39;base64&#39;);&#10;  res.locals.cspNonce = nonce;&#10;&#10;  const policy = [&#10;    &quot;default-src &#39;self&#39;&quot;,&#10;    `script-src &#39;self&#39; &#39;nonce-${nonce}&#39; &#39;strict-dynamic&#39;`,&#10;    &quot;style-src &#39;self&#39; &#39;unsafe-inline&#39;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;img-src &#39;self&#39; data: https:&quot;,&#10;    &quot;font-src &#39;self&#39; https://fonts.gstatic.com&quot;,&#10;    `connect-src &#39;self&#39; ${process.env.API_ORIGIN}`,&#10;    &quot;frame-src &#39;none&#39;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;frame-ancestors &#39;none&#39;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;base-uri &#39;self&#39;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;form-action &#39;self&#39;&quot;,&#10;    &#39;upgrade-insecure-requests&#39;,&#10;  ].join(&#39;; &#39;);&#10;&#10;  res.setHeader(&#39;Content-Security-Policy&#39;, policy);&#10;  next();&#10;};&#10;&#10;const reportOnlyCsp = (req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) =&gt; {&#10;  const policy = [&#10;    &quot;default-src &#39;self&#39;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;script-src &#39;self&#39;&quot;,&#10;    &#39;report-uri /api/csp-report&#39;,&#10;    &#39;report-to csp-endpoint&#39;,&#10;  ].join(&#39;; &#39;);&#10;&#10;  res.setHeader(&#39;Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only&#39;, policy);&#10;  next();&#10;};&#10;&#10;app.post(&#39;/api/csp-report&#39;, (req, res) =&gt; {&#10;  const report = req.body[&#39;csp-report&#39;] || req.body;&#10;  console.warn(&#39;CSP 违规:&#39;, {&#10;    blockedUri: report[&#39;blocked-uri&#39;],&#10;    violatedDirective: report[&#39;violated-directive&#39;],&#10;    documentUri: report[&#39;document-uri&#39;],&#10;    sourceFile: report[&#39;source-file&#39;],&#10;    lineNumber: report[&#39;line-number&#39;],&#10;  });&#10;  res.status(204).end();&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> strictCsp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">res</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NextFunction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span clas